[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3974.47, "timestamp": "01:06:14", "text": "。這只是發酵程度較低的版本。啊，如果是這樣的話，那這裡確實"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3985.51, "timestamp": "01:06:25", "text": "很安靜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3987.589, "timestamp": "01:06:27", "text": "所以，如果你不習慣發酵食品，你可能會覺得有點奇怪，你可能需要很長時間才能喜歡它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3993.349, "timestamp": "01:06:33", "text": "。否則，有些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3996.23, "timestamp": "01:06:36", "text": "人可能不喜歡"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4001.358, "timestamp": "01:06:41", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Money is not a problem Mam I need it"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4002.87, "timestamp": "01:06:42", "text": "納豆，根據我的經驗，我讓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4008.63, "timestamp": "01:06:48", "text": "別人吃納豆，他們不太喜歡，因為它畢竟是發酵食品，所以他們覺得很奇怪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4011.75, "timestamp": "01:06:51", "text": "。嗯。但對我們來說，就像我們的 linaga 一樣，我們吃它只是因為它很普通，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4014.23, "timestamp": "01:06:54", "text": "基本上是 akuni 或 pia 的發酵程度較低的版本。味道確實很好。"}]